<title>UK: NPI says Alastair Lyons to succeed McBrien as CEO.</title>
<headline>NPI says Alastair Lyons to succeed McBrien as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British financial services and pensions provider NPI said on Thursday Alastair Lyons would succeed Keven McBrien as chief executive this year.</p>
<p>NPI said McBrien would retire from the board at the beginning of July and Lyons would take up the post of chief executive at the beginning of June.</p>
<p>NPI said Lyons was previously managing director of Abbey National Plc's insurance division.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
